```

<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! carriage.bag.moves ~ the residency MOVE: an atomic ADD to the destination and a CLEAR from the source

`MOVE` pairs an ADD to the destination with a CLEAR of the title from the source, as one transfer: a live source lands its whole family in the destination (the root and its component slots) and retracts the family to absent in the source; the change-id travels, and one transfer-id ties the accession to the deaccession. A MOVE that names `--from` and `--to` and no `--title` promotes the WHOLE source layer, every live title it holds, in one act.

A MOVE of a tombstone carries a delete down: `--title` and `--from` with `--to` name the bag where the delete takes place; with no `--to` the bags holding the title print as candidates (and the line asks for --to). `--shadow` hides a title from a bag that holds none, a delete that shadows the lower layers, and rides a title-grain MOVE alone: a layer move, or any other verb, refuses it.

A terminal asks `Proceed? [y/N]` before it submits; `yes=true` names the intent off a terminal, `mu=pentacle` previews and commits nothing, `in-wiki=true` runs the act in the active wiki's island.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/shows`>>

!! shows ~ move-a-title · promote-a-layer · find-the-holders · shadow-a-title

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`example` name=`move-a-title` params=`title/lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/docs/pono/example from/lar:///ha.ka.ba/wikis/lares/working to/lar:///ha.ka.ba/bags/lares ~ land the title in the destination and retract it from the source`>>
<<has entity=`example` name=`promote-a-layer` params=`from/lar:///ha.ka.ba/wikis/lares/working to/lar:///ha.ka.ba/bags/lares ~ move every live title the source layer holds, as a promotion`>>
<<has entity=`example` name=`find-the-holders` params=`title/lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/docs/pono/example from/lar:///ha.ka.ba/wikis/lares/working ~ with no destination, print the bags holding the title as candidates for the delete`>>
<<has entity=`example` name=`shadow-a-title` params=`title/lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/docs/pono/example from/lar:///ha.ka.ba/wikis/lares/working shadow/true ~ hide the title from a bag that holds none`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/takes`>>

!! takes ~ title · from · to · shadow · change-id · in-wiki · yes · mu

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`arg` name=`title` params=`takes/title ~ the tiddler's title; absent beside from= and to=, the whole layer moves`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`from` params=`takes/bag-uri needs/required ~ the source bag (or the layer a promotion empties)`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`to` params=`takes/bag-uri ~ the destination bag; a title-grain MOVE of a tombstone may leave it out and read the candidate holders`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`shadow` params=`kind/switch ~ hide the title from a bag that holds none; names one tombstoned title, so a layer move refuses it`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`change-id` params=`takes/id ~ the change's own identity, named once so a re-send reads as the same change; absent, the verb mints one`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`in-wiki` params=`kind/switch ~ run the act in the active wiki's island`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`yes` params=`kind/switch ~ the intent a call off a terminal names in place of the y/N a terminal asks`>>
<<~ kahea uri=`lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/api/pono/affordance#/takes/mu`>>
<<has entity=`cell` name=`_0` params=`mu/pentacle ~ a dry run: the island walks the act through a capturing access and names the effect it would land, committing nothing`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/gate`>>

!! gate ~ write

Testimony: the door checks; this slot grants nothing.

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`gate` name=`write` params=`who/seat-or-hand ~ the vessel checks the writer's cap on the destination bag; a terminal asks y/N before it submits unless yes=true rides, and an agent off a terminal names yes=true`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/refuses`>>

!! refuses ~ usage · slot-without-root · cap-denied · outcome-unknown

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`usage` params=`cure/[[carriage.bag.moves title/<title> from/<bag> to/<bag>]] ~ --title, --from and --to stand required, or --from and --to alone to move the whole layer; --shadow names one tombstoned title and refuses a layer move`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`slot-without-root` params=`~ a slot subject refuses; a slot moves with its root (a root/path title stays)`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`cap-denied` params=`~ the writer's cap on the destination or the source bag falls short; nothing moved`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`outcome-unknown` params=`~ this process stopped waiting after the vessel answered; a short read found no receipt for this attempt's request id; read it back with lares vessel request <id> before any re-run`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/answers`>>

!! answers ~ done · preview · refused · candidates

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`band` name=`done` params=`exit/0 fields/[[verb status requestId receipt]] ~ the vessel ran the action and wrote its effect record; the receipt names the outcome tiddler`>>
<<has entity=`band` name=`preview` params=`exit/0 ~ with mu=pentacle the vessel names the effect it would land and commits nothing`>>
<<has entity=`band` name=`refused` params=`~ the vessel refused by name (cap-denied or a verb-error); the line carries its reason and cure`>>
<<has entity=`band` name=`candidates` params=`exit/0 ~ no destination named: the bags holding the title print, and the line asks for --to`>>
```

